[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 33206.068, "timestamp": "09:13:26", "text": "已滿。上下文說走進遊戲合作戰鬥，看看發生了什麼事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33209.03, "timestamp": "09:13:29", "text": "。  忽略。  等等，我得先把這把手砲升級，對吧？  是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33210.47, "timestamp": "09:13:30", "text": "。這就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33214.15, "timestamp": "09:13:34", "text": "痛苦之處"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33215.99, "timestamp": "09:13:35", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33224.908, "timestamp": "09:13:44", "text": "好的。我們去……嗯……舵手那裡。  是的。  舵。  嘿，我裝備了那個……呃，叫什麼來著？左輪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 33234.18, "timestamp": "09:13:54", "text": "手槍。我現在1250歲了。"}]